---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Medical - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Medical Care in China</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-12">
      How to see a doctor, what it costs, and when to choose public hospital vs private clinic.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Seeing a Doctor</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
          Walk-in clinics, booking appointments, and what to expect at a Chinese hospital.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Public Hospital vs Private Clinic</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
          Cost, wait time, and language support — how to choose the right option.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Emergency Care</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
          When to call 120, ER procedures, and what to bring with you.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Pharmacy & Medicines</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
          What you can buy over-the-counter, and how to get prescription medicine.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>